### Mobile App Order Creation Test

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:300pi
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login to get token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
[object Object]
email":marco@italiandelight.com,
  ssword: Password123,
 businessSlug": italian-delight"
}

### 1. Test Order Creation (General)
POST [object Object]{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]
  orderType": "DINE_IN",
 tableId": 1,
 items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 1
   quantity:2,
   notes": "Extra cheese please"
    },
    [object Object]
      itemId": 2
   quantity:1,
  notes:Well done"
    }
  ],notes": "Table order for mobile app test"
}

### 2. Test Table Order Creation
POST [object Object]{baseUrl}}/orders/table
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]
 tableId": 1,
 items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 1
   quantity:1,
    notes":Mobile app order"
    }
  ],
notes":Mobile app table order test"
}

### 3. Test Takeaway Order Creation
POST [object Object]{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]  orderType: AKEAWAY",
 items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 1
   quantity:1,
      notes:Takeaway order"
    }
  ],
notes": "Mobile app takeaway order test"
}

### 4. Test Order Update (Add Items)
POST [object Object][object Object]baseUrl}}/orders/1/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 2
   quantity:1,
      "notes": Additional item
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Test Order Status Update
PATCH [object Object][object Object]baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]status": "CONFIRMED",notes: "Order confirmed via mobile app"
}

### 6. Test Get Orders
GET [object Object]{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer [object Object][object Object]authToken}}

### 7. Test Get Pending Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/pending
Authorization: Bearer [object Object][object Object]authToken}}

### 8Test Get Orders by Table
GET [object Object][object Object]baseUrl}}/tables/1/orders
Authorization: Bearer [object Object][object Object]authToken}}

### 9. Test Order Completion
PUT [object Object][object Object]baseUrl}}/orders/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]  paymentMethod: credit_card,
 customerName": "Mobile App Customer",
  customerEmail": mobile@test.com"
} 